A better option would have been to wish for a blessed magic marker, to
write a few blessed charging scrolls for Orcus's wand of death. More
bang for your buck - especially considering you're not guaranteed 2
wands when wishing for 2 - you might only get 1. Absolute worst case
scenario, a magic marker will give you 3 blessed scrolls of charging -
best case, 18 scrolls! Although a wand may explode upon an attempt to
recharge it - you can usually count on getting at least 3 recharges -
hence a magic marker is a better option than a wish for 2 wands of
death.


